### DV-TUONG-04: Failed Status Cannot Pass Release Gate

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Critical safety change — failed predictions must not slip through acceptance.

#### [MODIFY] [config.py](file:///f:/Quanskill/ai/prediction/config.py)
- Add `RELEASE_GATE_ALLOWED_STATUSES = ["accepted", "needs_review"]`

#### [NEW] [acceptance_gate.py](file:///f:/Quanskill/ai/prediction/acceptance_gate.py)
- New module with function `check_prediction_acceptance(results: list[dict]) -> dict`
- Returns `{"passed": bool, "total": int, "accepted": int, "needs_review": int, "failed": int, "rejected_indices": [...]}`
- A batch passes the gate **only if** every result has status `accepted` or `needs_review`
- Any `failed` or `waiting_for_source` status causes the batch to fail the gate

#### [NEW] [test_acceptance_gate.py](file:///f:/Quanskill/tests/ai_tests/test_acceptance_gate.py)
- Test: all-accepted batch passes
- Test: mixed accepted + needs_review passes
- Test: batch with any `failed` status fails the gate
- Test: batch with `waiting_for_source` fails the gate

**Verification**: Only `accepted` or `needs_review` can pass; `failed` always fails the gate.

